#: includes/Settings/AdminPage.php:410
msgid ""
"Keys, certificates and registered metadata are stored in the "
"<strong>WordPress database</strong> (not in files), so updating or "
"reinstalling the plugin does not lose them. They are kept when the plugin is "
"deleted unless <code>WPSPID_REMOVE_DATA_ON_UNINSTALL</code> is set. Database "
"backups contain the private key: to store it encrypted, define "
"<code>WPSPID_SECRET</code> in wp-config.php."
msgstr ""
"Chiavi, certificati e metadata registrato sono salvati nel <strong>database "
"di WordPress</strong> (non in file): aggiornare o reinstallare il plugin non "
"li fa perdere. Restano anche se il plugin viene eliminato, a meno che sia "
"impostata <code>WPSPID_REMOVE_DATA_ON_UNINSTALL</code>. I backup del "
"database contengono la chiave privata: per salvarla cifrata definisci "
"<code>WPSPID_SECRET</code> in wp-config.php."

